@url = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = paste-jwt-token-here
@username = replace-with-an-existing-username
@userId = 2

### Public profile: biography, library, and reviews (no login required)
GET {{url}}/users/{{username}} HTTP/1.1

### Same profile with this viewer's follow state
GET {{url}}/users/{{username}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update your own biography, not someone else's
PUT {{url}}/users/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "I enjoy puzzle games and RPGs."
}

### Clear your optional biography
PUT {{url}}/users/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": ""
}

### Follow another user; repeat to confirm no duplicate is added
PUT {{url}}/follows/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recommended games and recent reviews from followed users
GET {{url}}/following HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unfollow, then repeat GET /following to confirm their content is gone
DELETE {{url}}/follows/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing user returns 404
GET {{url}}/users/nonexistent-profile HTTP/1.1

### Missing follow target returns 404
PUT {{url}}/follows/-1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Following feed requires authentication
GET {{url}}/following HTTP/1.1
